					<div class="asic-container asic-page ">


						<main id="main-content" class="asic-page__main">
								<header class="asic-page__header">
									<!-- Page header component goes here -->						
									<h1 class="asic-text-title-large">
												<span class="asic-card__icon" data-symbol="search"></span>            
										Search ASIC registers
									</h1>
								</header>							

							<div class="asic-page__article">
								
								<!-- Prose component goes here -->								
<p class="intro">Search our registers for information on business names, companies and people we regulate.</p>
<div id="filter-buttons" class="filter-buttons asic-button-group"><!-- FILTER START -->
<div class="tag-hide">Filter by:</div>
<button class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" data-filter="all" aria-current="true">All</button> <button class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" data-filter="popular" aria-current="false">Popular</button></div>
<!-- FILTER END -->
<ul class="asic-card-grid asic-card-grid-wide">
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="popular businessNames">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Business names register</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Find information about registered business names. You can also check if a name is available for registration.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="https://connectonline.asic.gov.au/RegistrySearch/faces/landing/bn/SearchBnRegisters.jspx" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to ASIC Connect <span class="au-visually-hidden">for the business names register</span></a> <a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/business-names-register" title="Business names register" class="asic-textlink">Learn more <span class="au-visually-hidden"> about the business names register</span> </a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="popular companies">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Company and organisation registers</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Search for information about companies and some types of organisations. You can also check if a name is available for registration.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="https://connectonline.asic.gov.au/RegistrySearch/faces/landing/SearchRegisters.jspx" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to ASIC Connect <span class="au-visually-hidden">for the company and organisation register</span></a> <a href="https://service.asic.gov.au/companysearch/">Try our public beta search</a> <a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/company-and-organisation-registers" title="Company and organisation registers" class="asic-textlink">Learn more <span class="au-visually-hidden"> about the company and organisation register</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="popular people companies">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Professional registers search</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Find out about a person or an organisation registered or licensed with ASIC to provide a service.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="https://service.asic.gov.au/search/" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to register<span class="au-visually-hidden">(ASIC's Professional Registers search) </span></a> <a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/professional-registers-search" title="Professional registers search" class="asic-textlink">Learn more <span class="au-visually-hidden"> about the Professional Registers search</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="popular companies enforcement&amp;compliance">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Banned and disqualified register - Organisations</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Search organisations disqualified or banned from providing financial services or engaging in credit activities.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="https://connectonline.asic.gov.au/RegistrySearch/faces/landing/banAndDisqOrgDetails.jspx" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to register <span class="au-visually-hidden">for organisations banned and disqualified</span></a> <a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/banned-and-disqualified-registers/banned-bodies-corporate-register" title="Banned bodies corporate register" class="asic-textlink">Learn more <span class="au-visually-hidden"> about the Banned and disqualified register for organisations</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="popular people enforcement&amp;compliance">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Banned and disqualified register - People</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Search people disqualified or banned from roles in corporations, financial services or the credit industry.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="https://connectonline.asic.gov.au/RegistrySearch/faces/landing/SearchRegisters.jspx" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to ASIC Connect <span class="au-visually-hidden">for Banned and disqualified register for People</span></a> <a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/banned-and-disqualified-registers/persons-banned-from-engaging-in-a-credit-activity-register" title="Persons banned from engaging in a credit activity register" class="asic-textlink">Learn more <span class="au-visually-hidden"> about the Banned and disqualified register for People</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="companies">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Certificates of transfer for licensed trustee companies register</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">View ASIC-approved transfers of estate assets and liabilities from one licensed trustee to another.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/certificates-of-transfer-for-licensed-trustee-companies-register" title="Certificates of transfer for licensed trustee companies register" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to register <span class="au-visually-hidden">for certificates of transfer for licensed trustee companies</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="people companies enforcement&amp;compliance">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Court enforceable undertakings register</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Access information about court enforceable undertakings ASIC has accepted.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/court-enforceable-undertakings-register" title="Court enforceable undertakings register" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to register <span class="au-visually-hidden">for court enforceable undertakings</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="documents&amp;data">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Data.gov.au</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Access data from the ASIC business registers that ASIC makes available for download through data.gov.au.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="https://www.data.gov.au/data/organization/australian-securities-and-investments-commission-asic" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to data.gov.au</a> <a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/datagovau" title="Data.gov.au">Learn more <span class="au-visually-hidden"> about Data.gov.au</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="documents&amp;data">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Document search</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Search for information about documents lodged with ASIC.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="https://connectonline.asic.gov.au/RegistrySearch/faces/landing/SearchRegisters.jspx" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to ASIC Connect <span class="au-visually-hidden">for Document search</span></a> <a href="https://service.asic.gov.au/companysearch/?Query=eyJTZWFyY2hDYXJkIjoiZG9jdW1lbnQiLCJTZWFyY2hUeXBlIjoiZG9jIiwiU2VsZWN0ZWRGaWx0ZXJzIjp7Ik9yZ1R5cGUiOnsiRmlsdGVyTGlzdCI6W119LCJTdGF0dXMiOnsiRmlsdGVyTGlzdCI6W119LCJMb2NhdGlvbiI6eyJGaWx0ZXJMaXN0IjpbXX19LCJTb3J0aW5nVmFyIjoiUmVsZXZhbmNlIiwiUmVjb3Jkc1BlclBhZ2UiOiIxMCJ9">Try our public beta search</a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="people">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Financial advisers register</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Find out where a financial adviser has worked, their qualifications and training, and the products they can give advice on.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="https://moneysmart.gov.au/financial-advice/financial-advisers-register" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to Moneysmart <span class="au-visually-hidden">for financial advisers register</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="people">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Infringement notices register</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">View people and entities who have paid infringement notices issued to them by ASIC.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/infringement-notices-register" title="Infringement notices register" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to register <span class="au-visually-hidden">for infringement notices</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="documents&amp;data">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Offer notice board</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">See how to access fundraising documents lodged with ASIC.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="https://regulatoryportal.asic.gov.au/offer-notice-board" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to register <span class="au-visually-hidden">(Offer notice board)</span></a> <a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/offer-notice-board" title="Offer notice board" class="asic-textlink">Learn more <span class="au-visually-hidden"> about the Offer notice board register</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="people companies enforcement&amp;compliance">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Public warning notices register</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">View notices ASIC has issued about the conduct of a person or entity in relation to a financial service or product.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/public-warning-notices-register" title="Public warning notices register" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to register <span class="au-visually-hidden">for public warning notices</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="documents&amp;data">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Published notices</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Search for the publication of notices, including insolvency and external administration-related notices.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="https://publishednotices.asic.gov.au/" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to search <span class="au-visually-hidden">for published notices</span> </a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="documents&amp;data">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Registrable superannuation entities document register</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Search documents lodged with ASIC by licensees for registrable superannuation entities (RSEs).</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/registrable-superannuation-entities-document-register" title="Registrable superannuation entities document register" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to register <span class="au-visually-hidden">for registrable superannuation entities documents</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="none">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Trustees for debenture holders register</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Access information about entities that have issued debentures and the trustees they have appointed.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/trustees-for-debenture-holders-register" title="Trustees for debenture holders register" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to register <span class="au-visually-hidden">for trustees for debenture holders</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="popular">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Unclaimed money search</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Find unclaimed money via our free service. There is around $2.6 billion in lost shares, bank accounts and life insurance.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="https://moneysmart.gov.au/find-unclaimed-money" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to Moneysmart <span class="au-visually-hidden">for Unclaimed money search</span></a></div>
</li>
<li class="asic-card-actions" data-category="people">
<h2 class="asic-card__header asic-card__title">Unlicensed carried over instrument lenders register</h2>
<p class="asic-card__content">Check the details of lenders with carried over instruments who have notified ASIC that they do not hold a credit licence.</p>
<div class="asic-card__links"><a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/unlicensed-carried-over-instrument-lenders-register" title="Unlicensed carried over instrument lenders register" class="asic-button asic-button--primary">Go to register <span class="au-visually-hidden">for unlicensed carried over instrument lenders</span></a></div>
</li>
</ul>
<h2>Other register access options</h2>
<ul>
<li><a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/other-registers/asic-training-register" title="ASIC training register">ASIC training register</a> - View courses and assessment services for financial advisers that were approved by ASIC before 25 September 2012.</li>
<li><a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/other-registers/nzau-connect-app" title="NZAU Connect app">NZAU Connect app</a> - Search the Australian and New Zealand companies and business names registers.</li>
<li><a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/other-registers/journalist-access-to-asic-business-registers" title="Journalist access to ASIC business registers">Journalist access to ASIC business registers</a></li>
<li><a href="/online-services/search-asic-registers/business-names-register/government-access-to-the-business-names-register" title="Government access to the business names register">Government access to the business names register</a></li>
</ul>
<h2>Other register information</h2>
<ul>
<li><a href="/online-services/online-services-information-and-support/service-availability" title="Service availability">Service availability</a></li>
<li><a href="/online-services/online-services-information-and-support/company-alert-service" title="Company alert service">Company alert service</a></li>
<li><a href="/online-services/online-services-information-and-support/personal-information-shown-on-the-business-names-and-companies-registers" title="Personal information shown on the business names and companies registers">Personal information shown on the business and companies registers</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.acnc.gov.au/">Registered charity (ACNC website)</a></li>
</ul>									


